{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102739","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102739/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102739/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102739/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102739","id":2846861030,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6pr6bm","number":102739,"title":"`var_to_bytes_with_objects` embeds Resources and can break global scripts","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-02-12T00:18:32Z","updated_at":"2025-02-12T00:18:32Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.4 and earlier\n\n### System information\n\nW10\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf you use `var_to_bytes_with_objects`, Resources will be serialized as any other object. This means they will get embedded in the data and re-instantiated when you do `bytes_to_var_with_objects`. In worst case it can break global scripts if you accidentally serialize a script.\n\nThis affects Objects and all properties, i.e. Resource properties will get embedded. There is a special exception for `script` property that makes it stored as path, but if you export a custom Script variable, the script will get embedded.\n\nThis is inconsistent with `var_to_str`, which stores Resources as path when possible.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRecipe for breaking script:\n\n1.\n```GDScript\nclass_name MyResource extends Resource\n```\n2.\n```GDScript\nextends Node\n\n@export var script2: Script = MyResource\n\nfunc _ready():\n\tbytes_to_var_with_objects(var_to_bytes_with_objects(self))\n```\n3.\n```\nParser Error: Class \"MyResource\" hides a global script class.\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102739/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102739/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}